---
layout: layouts/base.njk
bodyClass: page-guide
title: Set 18 trait guide
eleventyComputed:
  title: "Set {{ game.set.set }} trait guide"
  description: "Every Teamfight Tactics Set {{ game.set.set }} ({{ game.set.name }}) trait with breakpoints and champions. Study up for today's Synergle puzzle."
---
{%- from "partials/ad.njk" import ad with context -%}
{%- set s = game.set -%}
<article class="guide">
  <header class="prose-head">
    <h1>Set {{ s.set }} trait guide</h1>
    <p class="lede">{{ game.sharedTraits.length }} shared traits and {{ game.uniqueTraits.length }} one-champion traits in Set {{ s.set }}: {{ s.name }}. Trait groups are the backbone of most Synergle puzzles.</p>
  </header>

  <section aria-labelledby="shared-traits">
    <h2 id="shared-traits" class="section-title">Shared traits</h2>
    <div class="trait-grid">
      {%- for t in game.sharedTraits %}
      <article class="trait-card" id="{{ t.id }}">
        <header class="trait-head">
          {%- if t.icon %}<img class="trait-icon" src="{{ t.icon }}" alt="" width="40" height="40" loading="lazy">{% endif %}
          <h3>{{ t.name }}</h3>
          <span class="count">{{ t.members.length }} {{ t.members.length | pluralize("champion") }}</span>
        </header>
        <p class="trait-text">{{ t.text | nl2br | safe }}</p>
        {%- if t.breakpoints.length and t.breakpoints[0].text %}
        <ul class="breakpoints">
          {%- for bp in t.breakpoints %}
          <li><span class="bp-units">{{ bp.units }}</span> {{ bp.text }}</li>
          {%- endfor %}
        </ul>
        {%- endif %}
        <ul class="trait-members">
          {%- for id in t.members %}{% set c = game.champById[id] %}
          <li><a href="/champions/#{{ c.id }}" title="{{ c.name }}"><img class="cost-border--{{ c.cost }}" src="{{ c.img }}" alt="" width="48" height="48" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span>{{ c.name }}</span></a></li>
          {%- endfor %}
        </ul>
      </article>
      {%- if loop.index == 8 %}
      </div>
      {{ ad("inContent") }}
      <div class="trait-grid">
      {%- endif %}
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
  </section>

  <section aria-labelledby="unique-traits">
    <h2 id="unique-traits" class="section-title">One-champion traits</h2>
    <p class="section-lede">These traits belong to a single champion. "Has a One-Champion Trait" is a favorite Synergle category.</p>
    <div class="trait-grid">
      {%- for t in game.uniqueTraits %}{% set c = game.champById[t.members[0]] %}
      <article class="trait-card trait-card--unique" id="{{ t.id }}">
        <header class="trait-head">
          {%- if t.icon %}<img class="trait-icon" src="{{ t.icon }}" alt="" width="40" height="40" loading="lazy">{% endif %}
          <h3>{{ t.name }}</h3>
          <a class="count" href="/champions/#{{ c.id }}">{{ c.name }}</a>
        </header>
        <p class="trait-text">{{ t.text | nl2br | safe }}</p>
      </article>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
  </section>
</article>
